# The baker, at her stall on the square's west side. Her sign is the first task: the guard has it.

conversation baker in village
if sign_hung
  @ baker happy: Look at it! Fresh bread, and now everyone can see where.
else
  if has_sign
    @ baker: Is that my sign? Where did you find it?
    @ you: The guard was keeping it safe.
    walk baker to SignSpot and wait
    play baker interact-right and wait
    sound knock at baker
    @ baker happy: There. Now the fair can find my bread.
    set sign_hung
    jump progress in square
  else
    @ baker worried: My sign's gone. It was on the miller's cart when we came up from the stream.
    @ baker: Without it, who'll know where the bread is?
  end
end
